{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果（Apple）今日（29日）公布全新14及16吋MacBook Pro，首度配備支援觸控操作的顯示器PROLED XDR，打破多年來Mac機不設觸控屏的傳統。</p><p>新機配備M5 Pro及M5 Max晶片，和動態島（Dynamic Island）設計。</p><p>香港 Apple 網上商店現已開放預訂，11月6日起發售，售價22,999港元起。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:22:16.408082+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:54:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:16.855194+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:16.132177+00:00","content_hash":"6bf13e5197925b110c1c56c9fee806ddf6b1337ee49cfbda0eeb7f7070e58196","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}